WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.767
Every writer knows the feeling.

00:00:02.767 --> 00:00:06.300
A picture jumps, a list starts over at one,

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:09.033
and an empty page refuses to leave.

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:10.833
Meet Inkwell.

00:00:10.833 --> 00:00:14.767
A free word processor for Windows that lets you write beautifully,

00:00:14.767 --> 00:00:17.033
without fighting your document.

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:20.600
Start from a designer template, and every heading,

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:23.400
quote and table already looks right.

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:25.633
It opens and saves Word files,

00:00:25.633 --> 00:00:27.500
so you can share with anyone.

00:00:28.067 --> 00:00:29.933
Type a slash for a table,

00:00:29.933 --> 00:00:32.700
a contents page or a citation.

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:34.200
Press Control K,

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:37.033
and every command is one search away.

00:00:37.033 --> 00:00:39.933
Markdown shortcuts work as you type.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:41.867
And the things that drive you

00:00:41.867 --> 00:00:44.100
mad in Word are fixed.

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:46.267
Pictures stay where you put them.

00:00:46.267 --> 00:00:49.500
Lists restart or continue when you say so.

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:51.933
Pasted text matches your document,

00:00:51.933 --> 00:00:54.500
and Reveal formatting shows exactly why

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:56.933
text looks the way it does.

00:00:57.400 --> 00:01:00.767
Inkwell saves as you go and keeps a version history,

00:01:00.767 --> 00:01:03.033
so you can always go back.

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:06.700
For serious documents, there's a table of contents,

00:01:06.700 --> 00:01:10.700
footnotes, citations, comments and track changes,

00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:15.367
with PDF export that adds bookmarks and keeps your links.

00:01:15.933 --> 00:01:17.533
When it's time to write,

00:01:17.533 --> 00:01:21.233
focus mode clears away everything but your words.

00:01:21.700 --> 00:01:24.667
And it writes Urdu and Arabic beautifully,

00:01:24.667 --> 00:01:27.900
right to left, side by side with English.

00:01:28.367 --> 00:01:30.900
It runs on Windows 7 to 11,

00:01:30.900 --> 00:01:33.967
64-bit, 32-bit and ARM,

00:01:33.967 --> 00:01:36.467
and it keeps itself up to date.

00:01:36.867 --> 00:01:39.267
Inkwell is free.

00:01:39.267 --> 00:01:42.733
Download it at nomanshafiq.com/inkwell
